# Hold-for-Beau paths specific to this repo, one Python regex per line, read by
# scripts/local-review/local_review.py on top of the shared list in
# scripts/local-review/reviewers.yaml. A change matching any line needs two
# non-author model families to come back clean before the PR opens.
#
# In the blueprint, everything under scripts/ is review or merge pipeline: the
# OCR completeness tests and audit, the rollout script that re-stamps every
# consuming repo's pin, and local review itself.
^scripts/
# Project templates stamped into every consuming repo: a change here changes
# their agent rules and ignores fleet-wide. Matched by the naming convention,
# not today's file list, so a template added later is held too.
# Either separator, any case: codex-template.md, PULL_REQUEST_TEMPLATE.md.
(?i)(^|/)[^/]*[-_]template(\.md)?$
# The proposal spec the collaborator guide makes required reading.
^docs/PROPOSAL-FORMAT\.md$
